-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",53,{
[1665]="70054F3D\n1\tSearch for signs of Nidhlas and his men in Thuringwath\tNidhlas and his men might be found somewhere in Thuringwath. Mithrandir has asked you to continue ahead in search of Nidhlas and his men.\n2\tFollow the footprints deeper into Thuringwath\tThe footprints continue along the old roadway through Thuringwath. You discovered footprints on the old roadway through Thuringwath. You should follow them.\n3\tSearch Aufaltor for signs of Nidhlas and his men\tAufaltor can be found in Thuringwath. You have followed the footprints to the base of a great fane. You should search the fane for Nidhlas and his men.\n4\tExamine the slain Rangers in Aufaltor\tSlain Rangers can be found deep within Aufaltor. You have discovered a number of slain Rangers within Aufaltor. You should examine them.\n5\tExamine the heap of flesh\tYou should examine the heap of discarded flesh. You discovered the Rangers slain from bloodletting, but a heap of flesh has caught your eye. You should examine it.\n6\tReturn to Mithrandir\tMithrandir can be found in Thuringwath. You found a grisly scene at Aufaltor. You should return to Mithrandir.\n7\tHabla con Mithrandir\tMithrandir can be found near Aufaltor in Thuringwath. You have found Mithrandir standing before a great watching-stone in Thuringwath. You should tell Mithrandir what you have found.\n",
[1666]="70064EF8\n1\tHabla con Ransroth\tHabla con Ransroth.\n",
[1667]="70064EF3\n1\tHabla con Rock\tAl completar esta misión, recibirás una asignación de moneda de intercambio de Antes de la Sombra.\n",
[1668]="70043B7D\n1\tGive a tasty treat to a Chetwood chicken\030Give a tasty treat to a Gloomglens pullet\030Give a tasty treat to a Kingsfell hen\030Give a tasty treat to a Lossarnach hen\030Give a tasty treat to a Rushgore bantam\tChickens can be found all over Middle-earth. Rescue chickens using Radagast's calming treats.\n2\tSpeak with Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should speak with Radagast.\n",
[1669]="7005224C\n1\tGive a tasty treat to an Oatbarton badger\030Give a tasty treat to a Gloomglens badger\030Give a tasty treat to a Lasgalen badger\030Give a tasty treat to a Thinglad badger\030Give a tasty treat to a Green Hill badger\tBadgers can be found all over Middle-earth. Rescue badgers using Radagast's calming treats.\n2\tSpeak with Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should speak with Radagast.\n",
[1670]="70052240\n1\tGive a tasty treat to a Harloeg swan\030Give a tasty treat to a Mournshaws raven\030Give a tasty treat to a Limlight dipper\030Give a tasty treat to a Gravenwood warbler\030Give a tasty treat to a Bruinen thrush\tBirds can be found all over Middle-earth. Rescue birds using Radagast's calming treats.\n2\tSpeak with Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should speak with Radagast.\n",
[1671]="7005223C\n1\tGive a tasty treat to a Rauros snapper\030Give a tasty treat to a Long Lake loggerhead\030Give a tasty treat to an Entwash slowpoke\030Give a tasty treat to a Noman-lands tortoise\030Give a tasty treat to a Dunbog cooter\tTurtles can be found all over Middle-earth. Rescue turtles using Radagast's calming treats.\n2\tSpeak with Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should speak with Radagast.\n",
[1672]="70043BBE\n1\tGive a tasty treat to a Bindbole kid\030Give a tasty treat to a Brandy Hills billy\030Da una golosina a una cabra del Páramo Alto\030Da una golosina a una cabra de la Cordillera de Acebeda\030Give a tasty treat to a Lune River goat\tGoats can be found all over Middle-earth. Rescue goats using Radagast's calming treats.\n2\tSpeak with Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should speak with Radagast.\n",
[1673]="70052247\n1\tGive a tasty treat to a Redhorn rabbit\030Give a tasty treat to a Calembel cottontail\030Give a tasty treat to a Coomb coney\030Give a tasty treat to a Broadacres bunny\030Give a tasty treat to a Heathfells hare\tRabbits can be found all over Middle-earth. Rescue rabbits using Radagast's calming treats.\n2\tSpeak with Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should speak with Radagast.\n",
[1674]="70071A76\n1\tPick up the Mûmak Trainers' Horn\tNamâdi has asked you to use her Mûmak Trainers' Horn to train a young mûmak and bring it back to her at Khanâg Gur. You should pick up the horn from atop the wall next to her.\n2\tGo to the Spent-lodes\tNamâdi has asked you to use her Mûmak Trainers' Horn to train a young mûmak and bring it back to her at Khanâg Gur. You should go to the Spent-lodes in southern An Shêru.\n3\tBefriend a young mûmak using the horn\tNamâdi has asked you to use her Mûmak Trainers' Horn to train a young mûmak and bring it back to her at Khanâg Gur. You should use the horn on one of the young mûmakil.\n4\tBefriend a young mûmak using the horn\tTry once again to use the Mûmak Trainers' Horn on young mûmakil at the Spent-lodes, and bring one back with you to Khanâg Gur.\n5\tTry again to befriend a young mûmak using the horn\tTry again to use the Mûmak Trainers' Horn on young mûmakil at the Spent-lodes, and bring one back with you to Khanâg Gur.\n6\tTry again to befriend a young mûmak using the horn\tYou are finding it difficult to befriend a young mûmak. Try again to use the Mûmak Trainers' Horn on young mûmakil at the Spent-lodes, and bring one back with you to Khanâg Gur.\n7\tTry once more to befriend a young mûmak using the horn\tYou are finding it very difficult to befriend a young mûmak. Try again to use the Mûmak Trainers' Horn on young mûmakil at the Spent-lodes, and bring one back with you to Khanâg Gur.\n8\tTry once more to befriend a young mûmak using the horn\tYou begin to wonder if it is even possible to befriend a young mûmak. Try again to use the Mûmak Trainers' Horn on young mûmakil at the Spent-lodes, and bring one back with you to Khanâg Gur.\n9\tTalk to Namâdi at Khanâg Gur\tYou're pretty sure it is impossible to befriend a young mûmak by just using the Mûmak Trainers' Horn.\n",
[1675]="7007162E\n1\tComplete quests in Ahâba (total: 3)\tUnusâli has decided she will not trust you until you prove yourself to the Beltáni. You should complete three quests in Ahâba to prove yourself.\n2\tTalk to Unusâli\tUnusâli has heard of your work for the Beltáni and is pleased. You should talk to Unusâli in Ahâba.\n",
[1676]="70026193\n1\tAyuda a Erchiel en Amon Môth\030Ayuda a Lithuifin en Amon Môth\030Ayuda a Remmenylf en Amon Môth\tLos elfos tienen alguna idea de cómo aliviar el dolor de Ramalarga.\n2\tHabla con Lithuifin en las Agujas de la Linde\tLithuifin está en las Agujas de la Linde. Lithuifin tiene un plan para expulsar a los gigantes para siempre.\n",
[1677]="7006AE6B\n1\tDefeat Umâr\tLocate Umâr within Harkhaphâr and defeat him.\n2\tReturn to Dabôr the Breaker in Hulzidâr and present him with the journal\tReturn to Dabôr the Breaker in Hulzidâr and inform him of Umâr's demise and the recovery of the journal.\n",
[1678]="70020F04\n1\tRescata a Dagoras de Lhe Lhechu\tDagoras está retenido en Lhe Lhechu, al sudoeste de Echad Dagoras. Debes liberar a Dagoras y escoltarlo fuera del campamento dunlendino.\n2\tHabla con Dagoras en Echad Dagoras\tDagoras se encuentra en Echad Dagoras, al nordeste de Lhe Lhechu. Deberías hablar con Dagoras en su campamento.\n",
[1679]="70062D2E\n1\tExplora la cascada detrás del puente\030Explora la cascada del sudeste\030Explora la cascada del este\030Explora la cascada del noreste\030Explora la cascada del noroeste\030Explora la cascada del sur\tDrudwen te ha pedido que explores las cascadas en Clegur y sus alrededores. Clegur se encuentra en el suroeste de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes.\n2\tLleva la alfarería a Drudwen\tDeberías informar a Drudwen con la alfarería y las noticias del esqueleto que encontraste detrás de las cascadas. Drudwen se encuentra en el pueblo de Clegur, en el sur de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes.\n",
[1680]="7000B695\n1\tHabla con Bilbo Baggins\030Recoge Bilbo's Birthday Present\tBilbo Bolsón está en el Salón del Fuego en la Última Morada en Rivendel. Frodo Bolsón te ha pedido que le entregues un regalo de cumpleaños atrasado a Bilbo.\n2\tHabla con Frodo Baggins\030Recoge Frodo's Birthday Present\tFrodo Bolsón está en la habitación de Bilbo en la planta baja de la Última Morada, en Rivendel. Bilbo Bolsón te ha pedido que le lleves un regalo de cumpleaños a Frodo a cambio.\n3\tHabla con Bilbo Baggins\tBilbo Bolsón está en el Salón del Fuego en la Última Morada, en Rivendel. Frodo Bolsón te ha pedido que le des las gracias a Bilbo por su regalo.\n",
[1681]="70000D4A\n1\tLleva el Texto fundacional a Brombard Colazorro\tBrombard Colazorro está en la Casa de los Mathoms en Cavada Grande. Satisfecho con sus servicios, Belco Tejonera le ha exhortado a llevar su copia del Texto fundacional directamente al guardián Brombard Colazorro. No quiere que este documento acabe en manos de Adelard Tuk.\n",
[1682]="7004CE94\n1\tRemove angry scrawls (total: 10)\tYou should find angry scrawls on walls and doors throughout Dale and remove them.\n2\tReturn to Gaumar\tYou should return to Gaumar, who stands within the Great-keep in Dale.\n",
[1683]="70026C63\n1\tEncuentra el cebo de la suerte de Mosco\030Encuentra la caña de pescar de Mosco\030Encuentra la azada de Mosco\030Encuentra la capa de Mosco\030Encuentra la comida de las once de Mosco\tLas pertenencias perdidas de Mosco están esparcidas por los alrededores del estanque y la zona cercana. Si lees la nota que te dio, quizá encuentres pistas sobre el paradero exacto de su equipo. Deberías reunir las pertenencias perdidas de Mosco y devolvérselas.\n2\tLleva los objetos encontrados a Mosco Madriguera\tMosco Madriguera se encuentra en el estanque de Delagua, esperando que regreses con sus pertenencias encontradas. Deberías devolverle sus pertenencias a Mosco.\n",
[1684]="70051396\n1\tLook out from atop the Dáinlik\tThe Dáinlik can be found in the Ironfold. You should look out over the top of the Dáinlik.\n2\tInvestigate the base of the Dáinlik\tThe Dáinlik can be found in the Ironfold. You should investigate the base of the Dáinlik.\n3\tTalk to Rísti Graver\tRísti Graver can be found atop of the Dáinlik. You should talk to Rísti Graver.\n",
[1685]="7004F91B\n1\tFind and defeat Gundabad black-arrows (total: 3)\tGundabad black-arrows can be found along the Men Angrún, especially as it nears the Rushgate. The raven told Dori that cruel archers of Gundabad have been taking ravens' feathers for their arrows. You should defeat them and take their arrows.\n2\tSearch for the lost raven near the Rushgate\tOne of Arcah's ravens can be found at the Rushgate. After speaking with the raven, Dori has learned that the other two ravens sent from Ravenhill have not returned. You should search for one of the ravens near the Rushgate.\n3\tDirect the raven to fly to Dori and Company along the road to Thikil-gundu\tOne of Arcah's ravens can be found at the Rushgate. You have found the raven at the Rushgate. You should now follow the road to Thikil-gundu to the east and rejoin Dori and Company.\n4\tFollow the road to Thikil-gundu and and find Dori and Company\tDori can be found somewhere along the road to Thikil-gundu. The raven has flown from the Rushgate. You should now find Dori and Company along the road to Thikil-gundu.\n5\tDeliver the raven-fletched arrows to Dori on the road to Thikil-gundu\tDori can be found on a hilltop overlooking Stánbalk, the Stone Wall of Thikil-gundu. You have found Dori and Company along the road to Thikil-gundu. You should now speak to Dori.\n6\tFind the lost raven near Thikil-gundu\tThe lost raven can be found somewhere near Stánbalk, the Stone Wall. Dori has asked you to seek the raven that flew near to Thikil-gundu.\n7\tExamine the frozen raven, but remain on guard\tThe slain, frozen raven can be found on the ground before Stánbalk, the Stone Wall. You have found the frozen remains of a raven before Stánbalk, the Stone Wall. You should examine it.\n8\tTalk to Dori on the road to Thikil-gundu\tDori can be found on a hilltop overlooking Stánbalk, the Stone Wall of Thikil-gundu. You have learned that one of Arcah's ravens was slain by a cold-drake. You should return to Dori.\n",
[1686]="7002EF4D\n1\tTermina de ayudar a los rohirrim en el campamento y luego investiga la entrada de la cueva\tLa entrada de la cueva que descubriste se encuentra al sur del campamento de Mansig, cerca de donde el arroyo se adentra de nuevo en la Muralla del Este, en los acantilados occidentales. Utlac quiere que termines de ayudar a sus amigos en el campamento de los rohirrim en la Muralla del Este y que luego investigues la cueva que descubriste.\n2\tHabla con el hombre en la cueva\tHas encontrado a un hombre dentro del sistema de cuevas que se encuentra debajo de la Muralla del Este.\n",
[1687]="70052B1D\n1\tSearch the crossway to the old forest road\tThe crossway to the old forest road can be found by following the road to the north of Hultvís. Ríkmar has suggested that you begin your search for Hárskor at the crossway to the old forest road.\n2\tFind the source of the scent at the crossway\tThe source of the scent can be found somewhere around the crossway to the old forest road. You searched the crossway to the old forest road as Ríkmar suggested, but found no sign of Hárskor. However, you notice a curious scent lingering in the air.\n3\tSearch the Old Ford\tThe Old Ford can be found far to the north-west of Hultvís. You found no sign of Hárskor at the crossway, but you learned that Orcs are trapping the roads in Woodsedge. You should continue to the next location that Ríkmar marked on your map: the Old Ford.\n4\tSearch the path to the ruins of Hadhodiant\tThe road into the Beorning-lands can be found by following the road north from Hultvís. You found no sign of Hárskor or that he crossed the Old Ford. You should continue to follow the road north toward the Beorning-lands and search for Hárskor at the path to the ruins of Hadhodiant.\n5\tExaminar al orco muerto.\tThe slain Orc can be found on the side of the road through Woodsedge near the path to the ruins of Hadhodiant. You have discovered the mauled remains of an Orc near the path to the ruins of Hadhodiant. You should examine its corpse before continuing your search.\n6\tFollow the path to the ruins of Hadhodiant\tThe path to the ruins of Hadhodiant can be found in north-west Woodsedge. You discovered a slain Orc at the foot of the path to the ruins of Hadhodiant. Its wounds were deep and not unlike those made by a skin-changer. You should follow the path to the ruins of the old bridge and search for Hárskor.\n7\tTalk to Hárskor at the ruins of Hadhodiant\tHárskor can be found at the ruins of Hadhodiant. You have found Hárskor alive, if battle-weary, at the ruins of Hadhodiant. You should speak to him and learn what has happened.\n",
[1688]="70051397\n1\tTalk to Rísti Graver\030Talk to Aflur Smokebeard\030Complete Below the Dáinlik\030Complete Rumblings at Hammerstead\tRísti Graver can be found at the Dáinlik in the Ironfold, while Aflur Smokebeard can be found at Hammerstead in the Ironfold. You should talk to Rísti Graver and Aflur Smokebeard.\n2\tHabla con Náin\tNáin can be found in Járnfast. You should return to Náin.\n3\tInvestigate the southern mine entrance\030Investigate the eastern mine entrance\tInvestigate the entrances to the mine within Járnfast.\n4\tHabla con Náin\tNáin can be found in Járnfast. You should return to Náin.\n",
[1689]="700078E9\n1\tEncuentra el Árbol de la Horca\tEl Árbol de la Horca está junto a la orilla del río al sur del puesto de la condestable Wren, al sureste de Combe. El padre de Ted Abrojos fue un ladrón en el bosque de Chet y supuestamente acumuló una gran riqueza. Ted cree que las ganancias mal habidas de su padre están enterradas al pie del Árbol de la Horca, que debería estar marcado con una X.\n2\tAunque no hay forma de saber cuál tocón fue alguna vez el Árbol de la Horca, no estaría mal cavar cerca de algunos tocones en busca del tesoro.\t\n3\tLleva la piqueta de vuelta a Ted Abrojos\tTed Abrojos se encuentra al este de Combe. Ted Abrojos te envió a recuperar el botín de su padre de debajo del Árbol de la Horca, pero descubriste que el árbol, entre otros, fue talado por los leñadores de Combe. Cavaste en varios lugares del campo, pero no encontraste señales del tesoro enterrado de Abrojos.\n",
[1690]="700479DB\n1\tEnter the enemy encampment of Dûm Boha\tThe Haradrim encampment of Dûm Boha is located on the western slopes of the Slag-hills. You should seal off the maggot-hole entrances scattered around the encampment.\n2\tSeal off maggot-holes (total: 8)\tThe Haradrim encampment of Dûm Boha is located on the western slopes of the Slag-hills. You should seal off the maggot-hole entrances scattered around the encampment.\n3\tCompletado\tSealed off many of the maggot-holes in Dûm Boha.\n",
[1691]="70042E3B\n1\tHabla con Hundi en Echad Dúnann\tHundi se encuentra en el campamento de Echad Dúnann, fuera de los Muros de Moria, en Eregion.\n",
[1692]="7002EF01\n1\tRecoge la manta del hijo\030Recoge el vestido de la hija\030Recoge la hoz del marido\tPuede que haya restos de las pertenencias de la familia de Agela cerca de su hogar en Valle del Espino. Deberías buscar objetos que alguna vez pertenecieron a la familia de Agela. Podrían ayudarla a sobrellevar su dolor.\n2\tLleva los objetos a Agela\tAgela está acampada fuera de los muros de Valle del Espino. Deberías llevarle los objetos que encontraste.\n",
[1693]="70026C8A\n1\tVuelve a ver al rascacuevas hambriento\030recoge bayas (total: 5)\tRecoge bayas en el campo de tesoros para el rascacuevas hambriento.\n",
[1694]="70044AB2\n1\tHabla con Bert Bartolín en la ciudad de Forlaw\tBert Bartolín está junto a los establos de Forlaw, en las Tierras Feroces. Bingo te dijo que Bert Bartolín quería hablar contigo.\n2\tEncuentra al sabio en la puerta oeste de Forlaw\tEl sabio fue visto por última vez cerca de la puerta oeste de Forlaw. Bert Bartolín te pidió encontrar al sabio que llegó a Forlaw y comprarle algunas pociones y pergaminos.\n3\tHabla con el guardia de Forlaw en la puerta oeste\tUno de los guardias de la puerta oeste de Forlaw te ha llamado.\n4\tHabla con Bert Bartolín en Forlaw\tBert Bartolín está junto a los establos de Forlaw, en las Tierras Feroces.\n5\tEncuentra a Hunfredo Rebuscón en algún lugar al oeste de Forlaw\tHunfredo Rebuscón partió de Forlaw hacia el oeste, y Bert Bartolín te ha pedido seguirle la pista.\n6\tDerrota tritones congelados al oeste de Dunfast (total: 8)\tHunfredo Rebuscón provocó una plaga de tritones congelados al pie de las montañas al oeste de Dunfast.\n7\tHabla con Hunfredo Rebuscón en la ciudad de Dunfast\tHunfredo Rebuscón está en la ciudad abandonada de Dunfast, en las Tierras Feroces.\n8\tLleva los diversos artículos a Bert Bartolín en Forlaw\tBert Bartolín está junto a los establos de Forlaw, en las Tierras Feroces. Hunfredo tomó la bolsa de monedas que te dio Bert Bartolín y te entregó a cambio varios artículos.\n9\tHabla con Bingo en la ciudad de Forlaw\tBingo está en Forlaw, al oeste del Salón de los Festines de Forlaw.\n",
[1695]="7000B9FC\n1\tEncuentra a alguien que conozca el destino de Berto, Tom y Guille\030Encuentra a Berto, Tom y Guille\tLos trolls que aterrorizaron la aldea donde vivieron los abuelos de Garbert seguramente encontraron su final en algún lugar de las tierras salvajes del Bosque de los Trolls. Garbert vive en una cabaña junto al río en Tâl Bruinen. Garbert te ha pedido que encuentres el lugar donde los tres trolls de los que habló encontraron su final y que descubras la historia de su caída.\n2\tHabla con Garbert\tGarbert vive en su cabaña en Tâl Bruinen, a orillas del río. Has descubierto qué fue de los trolls Bert, Tom y Bill y has visitado la arboleda donde fueron convertidos en piedra. Deberías regresar con la noticia a Garbert.\n",
[1696]="7004521B\n1\tTalk to Bargwen\tBargwen is located in the southern end of Ost Rimmon. Go to Bargwen and tell her of Lady Glánhar's wish to restore the banners to the walls.\n2\tGather the banners (total: 6)\tYou should gather the stored banners from the store-house in Ost Rimmon.\n3\tReturn to Bargwen\tYou should bring the banners to Bargwen, who is in the southern end of Ost Rimmon.\n4\tTake the empty bucket\tYou should take the bucket and and fill it at the well in the centre of Ost Rimmon, then bring it back to Bargwen.\n5\tFill the bucket at the well\tYou should take the bucket and and fill it at the well in the centre of Ost Rimmon, then bring it back to Bargwen.\n6\tTalk to Bargwen\tYou should talk to Bargwen, who is in the southern end of Ost Rimmon.\n7\tPick up the pile of dirty banners\030Put the banners in the bucket\tYou should put the dirty banners in the bucket of water to wash them.\n8\tWash the banners\tYou should wash the banners in the bucket of water.\n9\tTake banners out of the bucket\030Hang banners on the poles (total: 6)\tYou should place the cleaned, wet banners on the poles to dry.\n10\tYou should place the cleaned, wet banners on the poles to dry.\t\n11\tTalk to Bargwen\tBargwen is in the southern end of Ost Rimmon. You should talk to Bargwen now that the banners are washed and hung on the poles.\n12\tReturn to Lady Glánhar\tYou should return to Lady Glánhar in the centre of Ost Rimmon and tell her that the banners are ready and will be hung shortly.\n",
})
